GsMinishark: {
	/* Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: hold the trigger and the shark tastes blood; fire rate climbs while the spread runs wild.
		At full frenzy every fourth round becomes a shark-tooth bite that tears the wound open.
		A 50-round drum swaps in one piece; nail the sweet spot to start the next drum half-frenzied
		''' */
	// Frenzy: Frenzy!
}

GsPhoenixBlaster: {
	/* Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every hit feeds the ember nest and the gun glows brighter; kills feed it faster.
		At 24 sparks the next shot is reborn as a phoenix that dives, detonates, and splits into three seeking chicks.
		Reloading breathes the stray sparks back into the chamber; a sweet-spot reload grants 8 sparks outright
		''' */
	// Nirvana: Nirvana!
}

/* GsBoomstick.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: each barrel throws 4 slugs that converge on your cursor instead of spraying.
	Where they cross, the jaws snap shut: a delayed bite tears whatever stands at the aim point.
	Break open to reload both shells; nail the sweet spot for +1 slug per barrel
	''' */

GsHandgun: {
	/* Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: land 3 shots on the same target and the 4th becomes a pressure-point round;
		it hits 80% harder and ignores 15 armor. The last round racks the slide with extra punch.
		Box-magazine drills: tactical reload is nearly instant, and the sweet spot is generous
		''' */
	// PointShot: Pressure point!
}

/* GsTheUndertaker.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: fell a foe, or wound one near death, and the gun collects a soul lantern
	that drifts back to mend you once per cylinder.
	The final chamber tolls the burial bell: a heavy blood round with doubled knockback
	''' */

GsRedRyder: {
	/* Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: copper BBs ricochet off blocks twice, jingling a bell with every bounce.
		Ring the same target five times in quick succession and the next shot is a gift round
		that bursts into festive shrapnel. Lever-load one BB at a time; fire whenever you like
		''' */
	// Gift: Gift round!
}

GsPewMaticHorn: {
	/* Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a seven-note magazine, do to ti, each pew tinted by its note.
		Land three notes in a row on the same target to strike a chord: a paint burst in the third note's color.
		Reloading plays the scale back up; catch the sweet spot on the high note for bigger chords
		''' */
	// Chord: Chord!
}

GsSandgun: {
	/* Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: sustained fire heats the hopper; keep pouring and the sand melts in the chamber.
		While molten, rounds leave as glass bolts that fly faster, pierce deeper, and shatter into razor facets.
		Reload pours in three rustling beats; a sweet-spot pour ignites the hopper instantly
		''' */
	// Molten: Molten!
}

/* GsBlowpipe.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: each hit on the same target threads in a venom fuse; three fuses burst into a lingering toxic cloud.
	Reloading is catching your breath, one dart per gulp; stand still to breathe 25% faster.
	A sweet-spot breath envenoms the next dart to detonate the fuses on contact
	''' */
/* GsBlowgun.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: one long breath drives 5 darts, each flying harder and faster than the last.
	The fifth dart empties the lungs: a heavy bolt that bursts into a broad toxic cloud on impact.
	Breathe back one dart per gulp, faster while standing still; a sweet-spot breath starts you at third-dart strength
	''' */
/* GsHarpoon.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: the harpoon flies out and winds back; the reload IS the chain coming home.
	Spear a heavy foe to set an anchor, then pull the trigger again to winch yourself to it.
	Light foes get dragged back to you on the return pass
	''' */
/* GsFlareGun.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: a four-color canister, red, green, blue, then white, each flare pinning into flesh and burning there.
	A pinned foe takes 12% more damage from you (16% for the white flare).
	Swap canisters in two beats; a sweet-spot swap fires the next pull as a double flare
	''' */
/* GsFlintlockPistol.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: two chambers, the second shot comes 40% faster;
	the last chamber fires a V-shaped double ball from a single bullet with doubled knockback.
	Hit the sweet spot when reloading for +25% on the next shot
	''' */
/* GsMusket.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: a true muzzle-loader; every ball is a stone-piercer that flies faster and punches through one more foe.
	Reload in three beats: pour, ram, prime
	''' */
/* GsQuadBarrelShotgun.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: fire one barrel at a time in a rapid four-count;
	the fourth barrel roars all at once with 8 pellets and hurls you backward.
	Aim down to rocket-jump. Break open to reload; nail the sweet spot for +2 pellets
	''' */
// GsRevolver.Desc: Reforged: a six-round cylinder; the final chamber always hits +40% harder.

